# Recorded input for the link page (widgets/link.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 80 in the default
# theme: Docs at x 12..58 and Home at 66..111, both on y 12..34. One line per frame below
# (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40, Space 44.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 80
dt 0.016
pointer 300 70
# 1: hover Docs
frame
pointer 30 22
# 2: hold it (it takes focus)
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: activated
frame
buttons
# 4: Enter: Docs fires again
frame
pointer 300 70
press 40
# 5: Space down: links take no Space
frame
press 44
# 6: Space up: still nothing
frame
release 44
# 7: press Home, drag off it, release: not activated, and Home keeps focus
frame
pointer 88 22
buttons left
# 8: dragged off, still held
frame
pointer 200 70
# 9: released off it: nothing
frame
buttons
# 10: Enter: Home fires
frame
press 40
# 11: a press on the panel takes focus away; Enter does nothing
frame
buttons left
press 40
